<h2 id="options">Build options</h2>

<p>
  The <code>options</code> object tunes the compilation and the response
  contents. Boolean values may be given as JSON booleans, or as strings
  (<code>"true"</code>, <code>"1"</code>, <code>"t"</code>) in querystring and
  multipart modes.
</p>

